Recommends: frei0r-plugins, xdg-user-dirs
Description: simple and local video editor
 montar is a free video editor with the basic features of consumer editors:
 import of videos, images and sounds, preview, and (in upcoming releases)
 a multi-track timeline, titles, transitions, filters and export.
 .
 Everything happens locally: no account, no cloud storage, no upload. Media
 files are referenced and never modified. montar can be extended with
 modules written in Python.
